WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:03,180
With Longmu City as your ear, if you dare to bite the hook

2
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:07,180
Destroy his feet, sink his feet, and cut off his faith.

3
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:10,180
I want only blood and tears to be left in the history books of alien races

4
00:00:10,180 --> 00:00:16,370
Let their descendants never dare to watch me get my mobile phone under the national dragon flag.

5
00:00:16,370 --> 00:00:19,370
Now that Hao'er has entered Longmu City, the plan will be slightly adjusted.

6
00:00:19,370 --> 00:00:22,370
Maybe a lot of people will die less

7
00:00:22,370 --> 00:00:26,060
Where are you?

8
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:29,150
We are about to enter Longmu City, ready to kill Chisu

9
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:31,540
We need to treat animals from overseas countries

10
00:00:31,540 --> 00:00:32,540
Give you two tasks

11
00:00:32,540 --> 00:00:35,540
First, Longmu City is the boundary of my country.

12
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:37,540
There are hundreds of thousands of people from the country living in the city.

13
00:00:37,540 --> 00:00:39,540
I don't care what method you use

14
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:40,540
Before my army arrives

15
00:00:40,540 --> 00:00:42,540
Don’t lose an inch of Longmu City

16
00:00:42,540 --> 00:00:45,890
The city is here, you are here, the city is broken

17
00:00:45,890 --> 00:00:46,890
You and those hundreds of thousands of compatriots

18
00:00:46,890 --> 00:00:47,890
Let's die together somewhere

19
00:00:47,890 --> 00:00:49,890
Save the last drop of blood for the country and come second
